window.products.push({"id":641071,"name":"Beaumode Black Gold Balloon Arch Garland Kit for Class of 2023 Graduation Anniversary Birthday Halloween New Years Eve Backdrop Party Decor (Black 01)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lwbVT6w5L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Different size all in one:The kit contains 134 balloons in there different sizes of 18\"/10\"/5\", 62 black balloons, 62 chrome gold balloons, 10 gold confetti balloons, 1 roll of 16ft balloon strips, 1 roll of 100 glue. Bio-degradable and premium material:The black gold balloons are made of high quality latex, which are durable and non-toxic. Latex balloons can support air and helium.Please do not inflate the balloon more than 90% to avoid sudden popping. Easy-to-assemble : The garland takes approximately 95 minutes to put together and does not require any previous balloon handling or crafting experience.We recommend using a balloon pump to help make things easier. Instructions for the garland as reference in descriptions,and you can create your own style by searching on YOUYUBE tutorials. Super stylish and classic balloon arch at an affordable price. Use it to impress all your guests and decor birthday and graduation at your next event!Please bear in mind that photo may vary slightly from actual item in terms of color due to the lighting during photo shooting or the monitor's display.If you want to get a rich and luscious looking,we recommend to buy 2-3 packs of this balloon kit. VERSATILE:This DIY balloon garland Kit is fully customizable! So fun and easy to do (no experience necessary), but yet makes a big statement! Perfect for a milestone birthday,graduation,anniversary or Halloween New Years party décor! Can be hung as backdrop, garland, centerpiece, table runner...the possibilities are endless!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lwbVT6w5L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaumode","source_asin":"B0C6MBP496","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6MBP496","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6MBP496","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
