window.products.push({"id":641098,"name":"Beware of Rattlesnakes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31AQOZF-WBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Combining generations of American manufacturing expertise with a go get 'em service team, Ninja Novelty Signs is now on Amazon selling signs direct from the manufacturer. We sell quality signs that ship with ninja-like speed and stealth for a no hassle experience. We know you'll love our products, but we're always looking for ways to improve and refine our ninja skills. Feel free to reach out and if you've got a suggestion or just want to tell us how much you like our products. You can also look us up on our website and check out our custom sign maker (just google ninja novelty signs). You'll feel as capable and cunning as a ninja yourself with how smart a purchase you're making (just don't use the signs like ninja stars).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31AQOZF-WBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ninja Novelty Signs","source_asin":"B00CCRVLJI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CCRVLJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CCRVLJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":641099,"name":"Skillet Guard Grease Splash Strainer - Set of 3: 10\", 11.4\", 11.4\" - Frying Oil Splatter Screens for Pan - Top Stove Screen Gaurd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-xMqWabqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"During various stages of cooking, these grease shield will facilitate the process and make your life easier. Heavy duty handle of oil splatter screen will protect your hands from the heat involved with frying food in the kitchen. Stainless steel of fry splash guard is easy to clean in a low cycle dishwasher, prevent splatter guard build up. Fry gaurd cover size fits most pots and pans and guards the full pan. A splatter screen for frying pan is perfect for use while simmering food, when needing to see and check on the food or at times when the food will get too hot while using a pan lid. Fine mesh of splatter guard for cooking allows proper air circulation inside the pan. Ergonomic feet of pan shield conveniently keep the screen on your countertop without it getting greasy and keep it in place on top of the pan. To cook safely, always use a splatter screens guard to avoid the dangers of hot oil & grease, boiling water and food particles from splattering onto you and burning you. Heavy construction of stove oil splash guard made of stainless steel. A durable and sturdy high performance stainless steel skillet strainer with plastic handle. Pan splash guard is provides full protection from hot grease and dangerous frying pan oil splatter. Grease splatter shield contains bubbling hot oils, simmering sauces, boiling hot liquids and food bits inside the pan. Each grease splatter guard has a convenient heat resistant handle to protect you during cooking - great for space saving storage. Stove top splatter guard contains bubbling hot oils, simmering sauces, boiling hot liquids and food bits inside the pan. Unlike other skillet splatter shield that take forever to clean, the fine mesh construction of this splatter guard blocks the grease without it getting stuck in it - just give your screen a wipe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-xMqWabqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFXDD","source_asin":"B089QRC31H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QRC31H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QRC31H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
