window.products.push({"id":641105,"name":"Peypike 120 x 120 Inch(10 feet x 10 feet) Super Large Flannel Throw Big Blanket for Family King Size Bed - Lightweight Cozy & Soft Red Plaid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ji7CJc7OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's BIG: Measured at giant 120 X 120 Inch that is much bigger than a normal 90 X108 Inch King size blanket with right amount of hang over to each sides; Two decorative seam lines in front side are perfectly on the king bed edges, they are decoratively and so soft that you couldn't even feel it during the night. It's so big enough for blanket hog fanatic couple by providing extra more plaids on it. It's FUN: The extra large flannel blanket is applicable to bed, couch, camping and any outdoor events. It's a BIG movie blanket for a whole family to sleep in it for movie by sharing plenty covering to every single members. It is a giant picnic blanket that can sit or lay for a 5 person family or even more. A smart four season camping blanket that could be use by one layer in spring and summer, doule layered in autumn and four layered in chilly winter night. Premium Microfiber: Made with high grade 300GSM of 100% premium microfiber polyester, this big blanket is plush, lightweight. Provides better fade resistance than other materials. Our microfiber blanket will not bunch up over time like cotton, which has little elasticity to maintain its shape. Other desireable features are its quick drying and resistance to wrinkling. Perfect Gift: People take it as a idea gift to make friends or family a big surprise or even a shock as it is so gaint and fun. It can be for any occasion! Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Christmas or simply a beautiful housewarming gift. This blanket will make a wonderful addition to any home or room. Easy Care:Machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle. Caution: NO FABRIC SOFTENER. Tumble dry with no heat, delicate cycle. DO NOT dry clean. Do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ji7CJc7OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peypike","source_asin":"B09CPRB9QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CPRB9QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CPRB9QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":641106,"name":"NWESTUN Portable Air Conditioner Sliding Door Vent Kit - Portable Air Conditioner Window Kit for Sliding Door, Max length 90inches, Adjustable Ac Vent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wzja1IDiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High quality material】Our sliding door air conditioner kit made of Heavy-duty PVC, anti-extrusion, anti-aging, can let you spend every summer cool, you don't have to worry about exposing it to the sun, it will not crack and peel off. 【Easy to install】The sliding door air conditioner kit was easy to extend to your door needs, very easy to install. You can choose to use 4 panels, 5 panels or 6 panels according to the length of the door, which is suitable for door with a length of 17 inches-90 inches or window with a length of 17inches - 61inches, be satisfied with the needs of different sliding door or window heights. 【Confirm Outlet Diameter】Our exhaust hose cut-outs are approximately 5.9\" in diameter, before purchasing, please make sure that the diameter of the AC Air Intake Outlet and Air Exhaust Outlet of your portable air conditioner is 5.9\". 【Package Includes】Portable air conditioner window kit Includes: 3 x Outer Plates, 3 x Inner Plates, 1 x Exhaust Hose Adaptor, 2 x Sealing Tape, 6 x Butterfly Screws,1 x bird guard(We have put it into the exhaust hose adapter ahead of time),1 x User Manual. 【100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE】 - We are professional Air Conditioning Parts manufacturers, very confident in the quality of the ac window kit, We ship the Sliding door AC Vent kit from LA and NY to ensure that you can receive it in time. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will response within 8 hours, You can return it for full refund within 6 month for any reason!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wzja1IDiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NWESTUN","source_asin":"B0BZS1K4J6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZS1K4J6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZS1K4J6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":641107,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Microfiber Sheet Set, Queen with 4 Pillowcases, Blue Dusk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OGUFah8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com Microfiber sheet set with pillowcases offers the best of both durable strength and serious softness. view larger Microfiber Sheet Set with Pillowcases What You Need to Know: 100% polyester extra-fine weave 120 GSM microfiber 100% polyester extra-fine weave 120 GSM microfiber Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 4 pillowcases (Twin includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases) Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 4 pillowcases (Twin includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases) Breathable and comfortable for year-round use; wrinkle resistant Breathable and comfortable for year-round use; wrinkle resistant Available in a variety of colors Available in a variety of colors Machine washable Machine washable Variety of soft, muted colors available, including Ivory, Taupe, Blue Dusk, Sage Green, and Dove Gray. view larger Pinzon Microfiber Sheet Set with Pillowcases Soft Microfiber Blend A brilliant blend of strength and supple softness, this Pinzon microfiber sheet set makes a lovely and long-lasting choice when it comes to quality bedding. Made of 100% polyester 120 GSM microfiber, the sheet set features an extra-fine weave for an alluring fabric that's resilient, soothing to the skin, and breathable--perfect for year-round use. The sheet set hangs with an elegant drape and works well as a starter set for a kid's dorm room, an everyday set for at home, or even a spare set for a guest room when you want to make out-of-towners feel welcome. Variety of Sizes and Colors The microfiber sheet set comes in five sizes: Twin, Full, Queen, King, and California King. Each sheet set includes a fitted sheet, a flat sheet, and four pillowcases, except for the Twin sheet set, which comes with two pillowcases instead of four. The fitted sheet provides stretchy elastic all the way around to ensure a snug fit on the mattress, while the extra pillow cases allow for extra pillows, which come in handy for everything from decorative daytime appeal to extra support when reading in bed. The microfiber sheet set offers a range of soft, muted colors including Ivory, Taupe, Blue Dusk, Sage Green, and Dove Gray. Each graceful color resists fading and will blend beautifully with existing solid or patterned comforters, throw pillows, and surrounding bedroom decor. Machine Washable For easy cleaning and care, the microfiber sheet set is machine-washable and can go in the dryer--or be hung out on the clothesline to dry on a warm sunny day. It dries faster than cotton or blend sheets and is wrinkle-resistant. The sheet set should not be ironed. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OGUFah8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00I3CSQLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3CSQLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3CSQLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":641108,"name":"LBW Personalized Christmas Ornaments 2/3/4/5 Family Name 2022 Christmas Decorations Customized Christmas Tree Ornaments Christmas Decorating(Tree 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p8D1OdDsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎄🎄【Premium Polyresin Material】🎄🎄LBW Christmas ornaments are made of environmental polyresin that’s both durable and lightweight for reuse, and the high-quality hand painting painting technology makes the color of product clear and bright (no printing on the back). Each resin decoration is equipped with red ropes, making it easier to be hung on a wall, door knob or window, or hung on your home Christmas tree. 🎄🎄【Personalized DIY holiday decoration 】🎄🎄Our Christmas tree hanging pendants are designed for families of 2-5 people, and you can choose the right product according to your own family. In addition, it is very meaningful to write the name of the family in the blank space with a thin whiteboard marker. 🎄🎄【Lovely decorative gift】🎄🎄The special element of Christmas tree and family symbolizes joy and hope, and brings good luck and blessings. Truly the perfect Christmas gift for your neighbors, family, friends, church members and grandparents. When they open this gift on Christmas or Eve, they will definitely feel warm and happy. 🎄🎄【Make Your Christmas Tree Unique】🎄🎄These Christmas tree decorations are great choice for winter Christmas, New Year themed parties and country farmhouse Christmas tree decor. It makes your Christmas tree look new, full of Christmas holiday atmosphere. 🎄🎄【Worry-Free After-sales Service 】🎄🎄LBW is committed to providing customers with high-quality products and assured after-sales service. If any hanging ornaments has any issues, please feel free to contact us via the warranty card. We will replace the product or refund for you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p8D1OdDsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LBW","source_asin":"B0BFQMB3PJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQMB3PJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQMB3PJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
