window.products.push({"id":641232,"name":"Sink Strainer Colander, Collapsible Colander, CanJoo Plastic Expandable Sink Colander Baskets Over the Sink Retractable Kitchen Sink Drain Basket Set ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x9CMZ+hGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional Sink Strainer Basket: This collapsible colander is easy to use and versatile. The extendable strainers can stretch over your kitchen sink to rinse veggies and fruit, drain pasta, thaw frozen food or use as a dish rack to air dry utensils, cups and small plates. The plastic colander strainer is also comfortable to hold in hand and can be used on your counter as a basket. No matter how you use it, we think you'll love this colander's versatility. Retractable Strainer Sink Basket: This kitchen sink colander is adjustable and expands from 13.6 to 18.7 inches to hold more or less, save space when not in use and fit most sinks. When the over sink colander stretched over the sink, the bottom of expandable colander is raised from your sink base, preventing drained pasta water from backing up into your food. Drains Quickly: The retractable plastic vegetable sink strainers evenly spaced holes and curved corners make straining and draining easy and fast and can help drain water quickly while preventing food from falling down the drain. The holes of the over the sink strainer measure up to 0.2 inches in diameter, so this collapsible colander strainer won't work for rice, quinoa and most small grains. Durable and Safe: These over sink colander is made of high quality pp material, which is no bad smell and heat resistance,strong and sturdy,hard to deform or break,also smooth surface and fine workmanship will provide you a relaxing use experience,which is supported to use repeatedly. The sink strainer colander is BPA-free, dishwasher safe, and heat-resistant up to 230° F/110° C. Space-saving and Large Capacity: Retractable colander is easy to adjust the size,free expansion and contraction,flexible use,so food strainer for kitchen sink can perfectly fit different size sinks.The expandable over sink strainer’s body design makes storing this plastic colander in any kitchen drawer,cabinet,or drying tray very convenient without taking up too much space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x9CMZ+hGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CanJoo","source_asin":"B0B6SLLDPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6SLLDPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6SLLDPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
