window.products.push({"id":641288,"name":"Weighted Blanket Cover 48x72 | Fits Most Weighted Blanket for Kids and Adults | Beige,Cream,Washable,Removable | 2 Soft Sides-Dot Minky, Smooth | 48x7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713LkkDCvDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE Other weighted blanket covers don’t have enough ties or they’re in the wrong spots! Adult weighted blanket designs vary. Our cover comes with 12 long, shoelace style ties & a large durable zipper. Use with weighted blankets with 5 loops, 6 loops, 7 loops, 8 loops, or 10 loops. No worrying about not having enough ties in wrong spots! 4 corner ties, 4 middle ties along each edge, 4 evenly spaced ties along long edges. STRONG & DURABLE 48x72 duvet covers for weighted blankets should be designed to last. Ours is! Double and triple stitching patterns. We don’t use cheap ties that rip and shred easily! Ours is designed to resist tearing and ripping much better than our competitors' covers for weight blankets for adults . Each tie pair can hold a lot of weight! We use strong, quality, 36 inch long zippers! Other brands have broken soon after purchase. BONUS DUVET COVER CLIPS Some weighted blankets just don’t have enough loops or loops get ripped. So frustrating! No worries, we’ve added 4 BONUS DUVET CLIPS to help secure our minky weighted blanket duvet cover! Sagging or Bunching in a duvet cover sucks! Snap the clips on and your eeighted blanket is secure. PROTECT YOUR EXPENSIVE WEIGHTED BLANKET WITH COVER A weighted blanekt is HARD TO WASH! Minky cover protects weighted blanket for adult and keeps it clean. Instructions included to EASILY put the heavy blanket duvet cover on & off of adult weighted blankets (48x72). EASY to wash! Won’t shrink. Machine wash warm, Tumble Dry Low. SOFT & COZY Minky is warm, soft, and plush! Dual textures! Dotted texture plus weight of heavy blanket makes a comfortable, heavy, hugging blanket for sleeping, taking a nap, or cozying up in front of the TV.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713LkkDCvDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grace 4 Serenity","source_asin":"B07LFVPK4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LFVPK4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LFVPK4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
