window.products.push({"id":641300,"name":"Cal Ripken Deluxe Reversible Australian Merino Wool Mattress Pad by Herington, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gkr8ZeYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wool is known as Natures Best Insulator and High Performance Fabric. We've designed the Herington wool mattress pad with one thing in mind. To be the highest quality and most comfortable mattress pad that you will ever own. Two pads in one is the best way to describe this unique mattress pad. The Herington Mattress pad is fully reversible for both summer and winter use. The construction of this amazing pad starts with a 100-percent Japara cotton shell. The benefit of using Japara cotton is that it creates a shell that is extremely soft and durable, making it the perfect companion for the high quality Australian Wool fill and top. Filled with 350GSM (10-ounce/yard) of 100-percent hand picked, specially enhanced Australian wool creates amazing loft and increased insulation properties. The top side of this pad is an incredible 500GSM (12-ounce/yard) of 100-percent high quality Australian Excel wool. The wool top is designed to regulate your body temperature to keep you warmer in the winter months due to the super-fine wool fibers that naturally insulate, breathe and wick moisture (sweat) away from the skin, keeping you drier and more comfortable. In the warmer months simply turn the pad over to the cotton side for a pad that rejuvenates your mattress for a better nights rest. A fully elasticized skirt keeps the pad in place and eliminates shifting and bunching. Herington rigorously avoids the use of chemicals in production of our Wool/Cotton mattress pads and we make sure that all of our products are manufactured from 100-percent all-natural components making an already perfect mattress pad healthy. We are proudly Woolmark licensed which guarantees that we follow extremely stringent guidelines of quality, purity and fiber content. This assures our customers the best product available. Herington comforters also available thru Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gkr8ZeYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Herington Australian Wool","source_asin":"B005Y9XJ50","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005Y9XJ50","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005Y9XJ50","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
