window.products.push({"id":641323,"name":"Coat Rack Shoe Bench, Entryway Coat Shoe Rack, 3-in-1 Hall Tree, 3-tier Shoe Bench with Coat Hat Umbrella Rack, Storage Shelves with 8 Hooks, Multifun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-5BTQmorL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【KEEP YOUR ROOM ORGANIZED】- Standing tall in fashion and with functioning simplicity design and style, this elegant coat stand will let your hallway, entryway or balcony more organised. It is really part of an essential unit of your daily life. This unit offers you a clutter free home and a comfortable life. 【3-IN-1 ORGANIZER】- With the precisely design, the screws locate in the hole well and the holes are line up with the shelves. The metal outer layer is painted by baking varnish, being rustproof. A perfect coat rack and shoe storage bench, allow you to hang your clothes, bags, umbrellas, and store your shoes, storage boxes handbags in a limited space. 【Spray Painted Surface】- This Metal Clothes Hanger made of powder coated metal tube, antirust and durable, won't be out of shape, strong and sturdy.Max Load Approx.80 kg / 176 lbs, Hooks Max Load.20 kg / 44 lbs.Suitable to be placed in the hallway, corner, sitting-room and etc. 【STABLE & DURABLE】- The coat stand is Crafted of Premium iron metal and PP material hooks to protect the frame from corrosion. The clothes racks use thick steel tubes with a diameter of 25.39 mm and a thickness of 0.55 mm and thick hooks made of PP material, so that the clothes racks are more stable. High quality materials guarantee the stability of the coat stand. 【EASY ASSEMBLY & DISASSEMBLY】- This free-standing hanger and shoe rack are easy to assemble. With the help of instruction manuals and tools (including Allen wrench), you can easily assemble the entire hanger. The hanger has 16 hooks, which can be disassembled freely as needed. All hooks have rounded edges to prevent damage to the clothes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-5BTQmorL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIIKOOAI","source_asin":"B08FJ6VH8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FJ6VH8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FJ6VH8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
