window.products.push({"id":641326,"name":"Murray Platform Bed with Wooden Box Frame, Mahogany Finish, California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712h77tManL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Murray is a contemporary platform bed that’s perfect for a recent college grad, city dweller with limited space or someone who craves the clean, uncluttered look for their bedroom. Constructed of solid environment-friendly Plantation hardwood, this bedroom piece comes with a simple slatted platform in a box design that’s intended to be used with a mattress only, without attaching a headboard. The 7-step Mahogany finished frame will coordinate with many styles or make a statement all on its own. Side rails, cross slats and center rail provides the support for the mattress (mattress sold separately). A good ornamental (or fashionable) bed will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent your other bedroom furniture and transform a room from ordinary into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit measures 11-inches (H) x 75-inches (W) x 87.5-inches (L), includes a base box, side rails, support rails, slats, instructions, and hardware bag with everything needed for bed assembly. The Fashion Bed Group Murray Platform Bed comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett & Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and barstools. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712h77tManL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076B7F8QY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076B7F8QY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076B7F8QY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":641327,"name":"Pack of 18 Halloween Wine Bottle Label Stickers, Halloween Party Decorations, Pumkin Event, Halloween Diner Supplies, Trick or Treat 4x5 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qbF471yrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"18 Pieces Halloween wine bottle labels party decoration The perfect Halloween party supply is both stylish and useful. This set of Happy Halloween wine bottle labels is exactly that and will be adored by your party guests. Use these creepy wine labels to cover wine, spirit, and other bottles for an added Halloween touch. They are even waterproof so they will remain flawless on bottles that need to be chilled. Details: Quantity: 18 pieces Style: 9 (as picture shown, each style has 2 pieces) Labels Measure 4\" x 5\", Sized to Fit Most Standard 750 ml Wine Bottles Waterproof & Easy to Use Application Instructions: 1. Line up your label to make sure it's straight. Use the bottle seam (if removing original label) or the edge of the original label. 2. Starting at the long side, lightly attach taking care to make it straight. 3. Once the edge is straight, firmly attach and roll the bottle while smoothing the entire label. Tips: For best results, remove original label but wine sticker labels will attach over existing labels if you choose to leave them. Attach to dry bottle for smoothest results. If wine is to be served chilled, attach label while room temp and then refrigerate. Please note, the wine shown is not included. GUARANTEE: If you aren't satisfied with your purchase or have any questions/concerns please do not hesitate to get in contact with us, we are here to help you. We stand by our wine labels with a 100% money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qbF471yrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"juccybe","source_asin":"B09DGBSJP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DGBSJP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DGBSJP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
