window.products.push({"id":641329,"name":"Lenox Holiday Nouveau Tablecloth, 70-Inch Round, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515S578NYTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Classic Lenox Holiday Nouveau pattern. 70\" Round machine care. Amazon.com The combination of jacquard damask fabric and classically colored accents make the Lenox Holiday Nouveau linen line a sophisticated way to dress the table for holiday festivities. Fashioned from a cotton-polyester blend, the line has a subtle sheen to its background, which features an ivory field set with tone-on-tone holly leaf patterns. Flowing tartan bands, strands of gold ribbon, and clusters of bright green holly with red berries add merriment and color to the look. The line is a beautiful accent to plain or gold-banded china and goes well with several of Lenox's holiday dinnerware patterns. Available in placemats, napkins, runners, and tablecloths of numerous shapes and sizes, Holiday Nouveau linens are machine-washable and safe in the dryer. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515S578NYTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B0000DHYZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DHYZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DHYZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
