window.products.push({"id":641521,"name":"Veracco Finally 21 And Cheers To 21 Years - Twenty First Stadium Party Cup Funny 21s Birthday Gag Gifts For Him Herr Party Favors Decorations (White/B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZsROc7nAL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"These cups are more than just ordinary drinkware. They are the life of the party, making every sip memorable. Crafted with care, our cups are designed to impress with their vibrant and eye-catching prints. Whether you're hosting a birthday bash, wedding reception, or corporate event, these cups are the perfect addition to elevate the festive atmosphere. Top-Rack Dishwasher Safe: We understand the importance of easy cleanup after a thrilling event. That's why our cups are top-rack dishwasher safe. Simply place them in your dishwasher, and they'll come out sparkling clean and ready for your next gathering. However, to ensure the longevity of the vibrant imprint, we recommend hand washing the cups. Hand washing not only preserves the design but also helps prevent any potential chipping or peeling, ensuring your cups stay in pristine condition for years to come. Unforgettable Party Favors: Looking for the ideal party favors to surprise your guests? Look no further! Our cups make for exceptional gifts that will leave a lasting impression. With their stylish prints and practicality, they are a perfect blend of form and function. Your guests will be delighted to take home these cups as a token of the memorable celebration. Long-Lasting Imprint: We take pride in delivering products that stand the test of time. While our cups are designed to withstand regular use, we recommend hand washing them to preserve the vibrant imprint. This extra care ensures that the design remains intact and prevents any potential weakening of the print. Enjoy the longevity of our cups and cherish the memories associated with each sip. Upgrade your party experience with our Perfect Party Favors Cups. Add a splash of color, convenience, and long-lasting imprint to your festivities. Whether it's a small gathering or a grand celebration, these cups are sure to make a lasting impression. Order yours today and let the party begin!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZsROc7nAL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veracco","source_asin":"B08TX59B8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TX59B8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TX59B8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
