window.products.push({"id":641530,"name":"Bathroom Sign Rustic Bathroom Rules Wall Art Decor Farmhouse Decorations Funny Modern Vintage Wash Your Hands Kids Cute Half Bathroom Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OXGxSW5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅FARMHOUSE BATHROOM DECOR: Hanging our wooden bathroom rules sign on the wall to create extra rustic sense for your bathroom. The bathroom saying on the plaque is perfect for the guests and kids as a friendly reminder, pay attention to personal hygiene and keep the bathroom clean and tidy. ✅RELIABLE AND DURABLE BATHROOM WALL ART: Not like others use the 0.12''/3mm-0.2''/5mm thin plywood board which looks very cheap and terrible quality, our rustic bathroom wall art is made of 0.32''/8mm thick MDF board, which is more durable and not easy to fade. Printed with UV technology, the pixels are high and colorful, then the hemp rope with 1.77''/45mm wide enough diameter is firmly hung on the wall and will never fall off. ✅PERFECT SIZE: No matter your bathroom is large or small, after several experiments, we found that the size of each plaque is 11.8''/30cm×3.2‘’/8cm is the most suitable, which requires 26.69''/67.8cm×11.8''/300mm area to hang. this perfect size allows you to easily hang anywhere in the half bathroom, including the bathroom entrance door, wall, glass sliding door, etc. ✅GREAT GIFT CHOICE: Our funny village bathroom hanging decoration is a great choice as a gift for your family, neighbors and friends. It has all the attributes of a gift: high quality, beautiful, and the words on the plaque are also a good reminder of the bathroom rules. Get it as a perfect gift for birthdays, thanksgiving, christmas, housewarming, various anniversaries, etc. ✅GREAT CUSTOMER SERVICE: We try hard to provide each customer with high-quality products and service. If the bathroom rules wall decor you receive is defective or not like, please contact us, we will reply in time and provide replacement or refund services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OXGxSW5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baihui","source_asin":"B099DY63Z4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099DY63Z4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099DY63Z4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
