window.products.push({"id":641540,"name":"AITEE Hot Dog Cutter, Hot Dog Cutter Slicer for Barbecue & Kitchen, Suitable for Hot Dogs up to 10 in, Use Hot Dog Cutter to Make Delicious Hot Dogs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ISC-3PEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For Delicious Hot Dogs - The hot dog cutter slices criss-cross slots cut pattern into the hot dog, allowing the smoky and grilled flavors to penetrate deeper. A hot dog that expands as it cooks, juicy cubes with crispy caramel edges grab the sauce for a tastier hot dog. Unique Design - Ergonomic handle design, comfortable to grip and easy to use, allowing you to easily cut multiple hot dogs in a short time.Precision durable stainless steel blade that won't dull and rust, you can clean it with a dishwasher and a small brush. It is the best choice for parties and barbecues. Easy to Use - Push the hot dog cutter down onto your cold hard skinless hot dog, when the cut is done, pull the hot dog off the blade from the side and repeat on the other side. Then you can get a perfectly patterned hot dog in no time. Perfect Size - This hot dog cutter is in size of 1.6×2.5×11.5 in, suitable for hot dogs up to 10 in. Lightweight and more comfortable grip. Precautions - This hot dog cutter is for skinless hot dogs without a casing. Take hot dogs out of the refrigerator, when they are still cold and hard, use hot dog cutter to slot them. Hot dog cutter are not suitable for sausages, bratwurst or any meat with casings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ISC-3PEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AITEE","source_asin":"B09PY63497","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PY63497","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PY63497","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
