window.products.push({"id":641762,"name":"SABRAGE Luxury Champagne Saber Sword with Display Box | Engraved 16” Stainless Steel Saber Blade | Ergonomic Aurora Blue Handle | Bar, Wedding Sword, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518eEAv8hBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Expert Craftsmanship: Silver Stainless Steel Champagne Saber Sword is 16 Inches Long, 2in Wide and 0.5in across the Top! Sleek Sommelier Sabre Sword weighs 10 Ounces (1lb 2oz in Lightweight French Themed White Gift Display Box). Hand crafted Champagne Saber Sword handles come in 4 accented colors: ✓B09L6LLPW1 Aurora BLUE Silver Trim Leaf ✓B09L6JC3JG Marbled WHITE Silver Trim Leaf ✓B09L6LMC93 Stygian BLACK Gold Trim Leaf ✓B09L6JWLHC Natural Grain Gold Trim Leaf Our Saber Sword is custom designed for Ease of Use: 1. Chill Champagne 45°F (7°C) 2. Remove foil, loosen cork wire cage 3. Hold Bottle at 30-degree angle 4. Run blunt side of Saber Sword along bottle seam 5. Use our firm handle grip to slide balanced blade upwards with a firm motion, hitting the lip of the bottle The pressure inside the bottle causes cork to fly off along with the lip of the bottle, awing your guests with a dramatic \"pop\" and spray of champagne. Serve and Toast Champagne in Glasses! Napoleon’s elite Hussar Cavalry celebrated victories by opening bottles of champagne with their trusted Sabres: SABRAGE is a popular tradition at weddings, celebrations and special events. ✓Our Champagne Swords are laser engraved \"Sabrage L'art de sabrer le champagne,\" meaning Sabering a champagne bottle and pair perfectly with your favorite champagne glasses and party toasts! ✓Saber Swords make unique housewarming or perfect anniversary gifts! ✓Great present for knife, bottle & sword collectors! Saber Champagne Opener with artisanal Gift Box: Packed in an elegant protective white French gift box engraved with our SABRAGE logo. ✓Molded suede gift box interior protects Saber Sword during transport & storage. ✓Hidden magnetic close mechanism makes it easy to display & present the Saber Sword. ✓Beautiful gift box has the perfect combination of style, functionality, and elegance and is sure to impress any champagne lover or party host. ✓Gift box is perfect for home bar, bar wall or wine rack. USA Designed and Tested: Safety is key when Sabering a champagne bottle. ✓ Our professional Champagne Saber Swords conform to the highest safety standards for barware & bar tool accessories. ✓Your satisfaction is our #1 priority. ✓Our Saber Swords are 100% lifetime guaranteed. ✓Our USA customer service team will gladly replace or refund your Champagne Saber at no cost to you. Clients love to use our SABRAGE Saber Swords at parties and add them to their home bar collection. Check out their reviews!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518eEAv8hBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sabrage","source_asin":"B09L6LLPW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L6LLPW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L6LLPW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
