window.products.push({"id":641875,"name":"Asaya Canvas Chef Knife Roll Bag - 10 Knife Slots and a Large Zipper Pocket - Durable 10oz Canvas Knife Case with an Adjustable Shoulder Strap - Knive","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kb5QmoeHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a safe way to transport your chef knives? A good set of knives is essential for every amateur and professional chef, but it's also one of the most difficult things to carry around. They can't just be thrown into a box together; this can cause a lot of damage to each one, scratching the surface or even dulling their blades. Knives are dangerous and so it is important that they have their own special case, with separate and secured compartments for each one. Asaya's portable knife roll guarantees you won't lose a finger or damage the blades while transporting your knives. It’s made of extra tough 10oz canvas for maximum durability and protection from cuts, scratches and damage.  The knife roll has 10 total knife slots and a large zipper pocket. It can easily accommodate an entire professional knife set, including chef knives (up to 17” long), honing rod, butchers’ knife, pens, silverware, and other essential culinary utensils.  This professional knife roll is ergonomically designed to be easy to carry with an adjustable strap that can go over your right or left shoulder. It is ideal for the chef that is on the go - be it you are still a culinary student needing to bring your tools to school daily or a chef on the way to a catering gig.  List of features:  ✅ 10 full sized knife slots with a protective covering and a large zippered compartment.  ✅ Can hold knives up to 17 inches long!  ✅ Measurements: 18\"H x 10\"W.  ✅ Expert craftsmanship. Made with tough 10oz canvas  ✅ Convenient way of traveling and transporting knives without fear of damaging the blades. Give your knives the respect they deserve and transport them safely and securely with Asaya's portable knife roll!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kb5QmoeHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asaya","source_asin":"B08HGHSRT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HGHSRT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HGHSRT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
