window.products.push({"id":641994,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 4x4 (2-Pack), Antique Gold, Vintage Style Brass and Glass, Metal Floating Picture Frame with Locket Closure, for Photos, Art, & More, Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gm80oc2sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs Vintage Style Glass floating frame with the vintage-inspired locket closure combines the traditional look of antique frames with the modern design of contemporary picture frames. Whether you are filling these frames with beautiful landscape or portrait shots, when viewed inside the pressed glass, your photos will capture the eye like works of art. The striking frame, featuring trim, metal edges, stands securely on a thin metal easel. The sophisticated allure of the frame adds a boost of style to any desk, shelf, or mantlepiece. All eyes will be drawn to the photos you choose to “float” inside the glass panes. To create the “floating” effect, insert a smaller photo and add a tiny piece of tape to hold the photo in place. The chic design and simple functionality of the locket closure completes this modern metallic frame’s charm. Gently slide up the bar to raise the clasp and insert a photo. Slide down to securely close. Pressed flowers will look gorgeous inside the wide-open glass surface. Showcase thin keepsakes, illustrations, and drawings inside the pressed glass. The timeless appeal of this elegant frame makes it a stunning display frame choice for hotels, restaurants, and retail store countertops. A special event deserves a truly special frame and these charming frames will put love on display as frames for wedding centerpieces. The sentiment of love will be felt from your guests when you use these frames for moments to remember like graduation parties and baby showers. These charming picture frames make a welcome gift choice for friends, family, and co-workers. We spend so much time flipping through images on screens all day, it feels good to see our memories and passions preserved in style. [NOTE: THIS FRAME CAN NOT BE MOUNTED ON A WALL]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gm80oc2sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B08742RHLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-641994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08742RHLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08742RHLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
